Area and Volume 1|1.15|50774285|407|A|mcq|-|Each base of a right rectangular prism has length 19 in and width 8 in. Volume is 2736 cubic inches. What is the height, in inches?|18;27;144;152|A=V/(lw) CORRECT; B=misdivision; C=V/19 (divided by one edge only); D=l*w (the base area itself)
