Linear Equations in Two Variables 1|1.20|b9839f9e|502|B|mcq|-|F=2.50x+7.00y gives total charge for x drinks and y salads. Best interpretation of 7.00?|Price of one drink;Price of one salad;Number of drinks bought;Number of salads bought|7.00 is the coefficient of y (salads); A=matched it to the wrong variable; C/D=confuse price with quantity; B=CORRECT
