Linear Equations in Two Variables 1|1.33|cea27ab2|629|A|mcq|table-choices|For 7x-4y=-84, which table gives three x values and their corresponding y values?|x 0,4,8 with y 21,28,35;x 0,4,8 with y 35,28,21;x 21,28,35 with y 0,4,8;x 21,28,35 with y 8,4,0|A=CORRECT; B=decreasing y (sign error on slope); C/D=swapped the roles of x and y
