Sample Statistics and Margin of Error 1|1.4|0108ac2d|515|C|mcq|-|300 randomly selected students gave 38 percent support with a 5.5 percent margin of error. Best interpretation?|Percent is exactly 38;Percent is greater than 38;Plausible values are between 32.5 and 43.5;Plausible numbers are between 295 and 305|C=estimate plus or minus the margin CORRECT; A=treats the estimate as exact; B=one-sided; D=applies the margin to the sample size
