Sample Statistics and Margin of Error 1|1.6|2c76bcce|487|A|mcq|-|Estimated mean handbag weight is 27.8 oz with a margin of error of 0.02 oz. Most plausible conclusion?|Mean of all handbags is between 27.78 and 27.82;Actual weights of all handbags are between 27.78 and 27.82;Actual weights in the sample are between 27.78 and 27.82;Mean is exactly 27.8|A=the interval estimates the MEAN CORRECT; B/C=apply the interval to individual values; D=treats the estimate as exact
