Lines, Angles, and Triangles 3|3.7|eeb4143c|358|10/3, 15/4, 25/6|spr|right-triangle-5-7|Triangle ABC has AC split into segments 5 and 7 with height y at C and height x at the 5-mark. The area is at least 48 and at most 60 and y is an integer. What is one possible value of x?|-|SPR: 8<=y<=10 and x=5y/12 gives 10/3, 15/4, or 25/6; all three accepted
