Lines, Angles, and Triangles 3|3.9|17912810|559|50.5|spr|parallel-lines-q-t|Parallel lines q and t are cut by lines r and s. If a=43 and b=122, what is the value of w?|-|SPR: triangle angles 43, 58, 79 so 2w+79=180 and w=50.5
