Nonlinear Equations and Systems 1|1.11|4236c5a3|424|D|mcq|-|If (x+5)^2=4, which is a possible value of x?|1;-1;-2;-3|Square root gives x+5=2 or -2 so x=-3 or -7; A/B/C=dropped the shift or the sign; D=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 1|1.12|f11ffa93|278|117|spr|-|sqrt(x+4)=11. What value of x satisfies the equation?|-|SPR: x+4=121 so x=117; error 7 (subtracted before squaring)
