Nonlinear Equations and Systems 1|1.16|b8c4a1cd|426|D|mcq|-|8j=k+15m relates distinct positive numbers. Which equation expresses j in terms of k and m?|j=k/8+15m;j=k+15m/8;j=8(k+15m);j=(k+15m)/8|Divide the whole right side by 8; A/B=divided only one term; C=multiplied; D=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 1|1.17|7a8cb72a|460|A|mcq|-|7m=2(n+p) relates positive numbers m, n, p. Which equation gives m in terms of n and p?|m=2(n+p)/7;m=2(n+p);m=2(n+p)-7;m=2-n-p-7|Divide both sides by 7; B=forgot to divide; C/D=subtracted instead; A=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 1|1.18|d0e8e8f5|1200|D|mcq|graph-parabola-line|A graph shows a parabola with vertex (4,1) and a horizontal line tangent at that point. What is the solution (x,y) to the system?|(0,0);(-4,1);(4,-1);(4,1)|Read the single point of intersection; A=the origin; B/C=sign errors on a coordinate; D=CORRECT
