Nonlinear Equations and Systems 1|1.22|332cd67b|407|B|mcq|-|How many distinct real solutions are there to 3x^2-15x+18=0?|Exactly one;Exactly two;Infinitely many;Zero|Factors to 3(x-2)(x-3) with a positive discriminant; A=assumed a repeated root; D=assumed no real roots; B=CORRECT
