Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.4|911383f2|496|D|mcq|-|What is the product of the solutions to (x-4)(x+2)(x-1)=0?|8;3;-3;-8|Roots are 4, -2, 1 so the product is -8; B=the sum; A=dropped the sign; C=misc; D=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.5|b80d10d7|451|B|mcq|-|What is the solution to 2(x+1)/(x+5)=1-1/(x+5)?|0;2;3;5|Clearing denominators gives 2x+2=x+4; A/C/D=arithmetic slips; B=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.6|fcdf87b7|306|0, 3|spr|-|For the system y=x^2-4x+4 and y=4-x, what is one possible value of x?|-|SPR: x^2-3x=0 so x=0 or x=3; both accepted
