Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.9|802549ac|496|A|mcq|-|Which is a solution to (x+2)(x+3)=(x-2)(x-3)+10?|1;0;-2;-5|Expanding gives 10x=10 so x=1; B/C/D=do not satisfy; A=CORRECT
