Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.12|c77ef2fb|593|A|mcq|-|Blood volume is VB=VP/(1-H). Which expresses H in terms of VB and VP?|H=1-VP/VB;H=VB/VP;H=1+VB/VP;H=VB-VP|Solve 1-H=VP/VB; B/C=inverted or wrong sign; D=subtracted volumes; A=CORRECT
