Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.21|3b4b8831|242|-3|spr|-|38x^2=38(9). What is the negative solution to the given equation?|-|SPR: x^2=9 so the negative root is -3
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.22|f5247e52|460|C|mcq|-|y=ax^2-c with a and c positive. How many times does its graph intersect the graph of y=a+c?|Zero;One;Two;More than two|Setting equal gives x^2=(a+2c)/a which is positive so there are two solutions; A/B=assumed no or one crossing; C=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.23|f76c1858|223|4|spr|-|7x^2-20x-32=0. What is the positive solution?|-|SPR: (7x+8)(x-4)=0 so the positive root is 4
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.24|4e18fc5d|445|A|mcq|-|v=-w/(150x) relates distinct positive numbers. Which expresses w in terms of v and x?|w=-150vx;w=-150v/x;w=-x/(150v);w=v+150x|Multiply both sides by -150x; B/C=divided instead of multiplying; D=added; A=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.25|bef4b1c6|244|5|spr|-|55/(x+6)=x. What is the positive solution?|-|SPR: x^2+6x-55=0 gives x=5 or -11 so the positive root is 5
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.26|11ccf3e1|400|A|mcq|-|14j+5k=m relates j, k, m. Which expresses k in terms of j and m?|k=(m-14j)/5;k=(1/5)m-14j;k=(14j-m)/5;k=5m-14j|Subtract 14j then divide everything by 5; B=divided only one term; C=sign error; D=multiplied; A=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.27|29ed5d39|478|D|mcq|-|p=9+14/n with n not 0 and p>9. Which expresses n in terms of p?|n=(p-9)/14;n=p/14+9;n=p/14-9;n=14/(p-9)|Isolate 14/n then invert; A=inverted the wrong way; B/C=divided p by 14 first; D=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.28|895628b5|421|C|mcq|-|For y=(x-2)(x+4) and y=6x-12, which ordered pair is the solution?|(0,2);(-4,2);(2,0);(2,-4)|Setting equal gives (x-2)^2=0 so x=2 and y=0; A/B=used a factor root; D=wrong y; C=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.29|13e57f0a|395|B|mcq|-|-4x^2-7x=-36. What is the positive solution?|7/4;9/4;4;7|Rearranged 4x^2+7x-36=0 gives x=9/4 or -4; A=used b/a; C/D=copied constants; B=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.30|6acdcece|455|D|mcq|-|b-72=x/y relates positive numbers. Which expresses x in terms of b and y?|x=(b-72)/y;x=by-72;x=(by-72)/y;x=by-72y|Multiply both sides by y and distribute; A=divided instead; B=failed to distribute y to 72; C=divided again; D=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.31|09e5e4d3|382|C|mcq|-|If 42/x=7x, what is the value of 7x^2?|6;7;42;294|Cross-multiplying gives 7x^2=42 directly; A/B=solved for x instead; D=multiplied by 7 again; C=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 2|2.32|4b6f0a3f|243|5|spr|-|What is the sum of the solutions to x^2-5x-24=0?|-|SPR: sum equals -b/a=5
