Nonlinear Equations and Systems 3|3.29|88a0c425|407|B|mcq|-|-2x^2+20x+c=0 has exactly one solution. What is the value of c?|-68;-50;-32;0|Discriminant 400+8c=0 so c=-50; A/C/D=arithmetic slips or ignoring the leading coefficient; B=CORRECT
Nonlinear Equations and Systems 3|3.30|722de804|244|94|spr|-|What is the sum of the solutions to (x-47)^2=1?|-|SPR: x=48 or 46 so the sum is 94
