Nonlinear Functions 1|1.7|7160cbb3|800|A|mcq|exponential-graph-asymptote|An exponential curve rises steeply and levels off at y=-5, crossing the y-axis at -6. What is the y-intercept of the graph shown?|(0,-6);(-6,0);(0,0);(-5,-5)|The y-intercept has x=0; B=swapped coordinates; C=assumed the origin; D=used the asymptote; A=CORRECT
